  "cues": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "shot": "01-truck",
      "text": "撞到我之前，那辆重卡先散架了。",
      "reading_units": 13,
      "start_frame": 0,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 52
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "shot": "01-truck",
      "text": "我提着鸡蛋站在路边，连一块皮都没擦破。",
      "reading_units": 17,
      "start_frame": 52,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 120
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "shot": "02-contract",
      "text": "昨晚，我花一块钱，买下一份永久保命的保险。",
      "reading_units": 18,
      "start_frame": 120,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 192
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "shot": "02-contract",
      "text": "合同只保我一个，第一次救命之后，就再也不能退。",
      "reading_units": 20,
      "start_frame": 192,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 272
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "shot": "03-medicine",
      "text": "我原本已经癌症晚期，医院却突然给了我免费新药。",
      "reading_units": 21,
      "start_frame": 272,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 356
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "shot": "03-medicine",
      "text": "三周后，我竟然好转了。我以为，自己终于能回家。",
      "reading_units": 19,
      "start_frame": 356,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 432
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "shot": "04-duoduo",
      "text": "可我在病房门口，遇见了一个抱着白兔的小女孩。",
      "reading_units": 20,
      "start_frame": 432,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 512
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "shot": "04-duoduo",
      "text": "她叫朵朵。她也等着救命，可她妈妈根本买不起药。",
      "reading_units": 20,
      "start_frame": 512,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 592
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "shot": "05-donation",
      "text": "我把药递给医生，让他先帮孩子。保险立刻又补来一盒。",
      "reading_units": 22,
      "start_frame": 592,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 680
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "shot": "05-donation",
      "text": "我想，既然主动冒险也保，那它补一盒，我就捐一盒。",
      "reading_units": 20,
      "start_frame": 680,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 760
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "shot": "06-free-medicine",
      "text": "我坚持让别人先拿到药，才肯接受自己的那一份。",
      "reading_units": 20,
      "start_frame": 760,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 840
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "shot": "06-free-medicine",
      "text": "三天后，医院开了免费窗口。我第一次觉得，自己能救别人。",
      "reading_units": 23,
      "start_frame": 840,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 932
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "shot": "07-checkpoint",
      "text": "我又跟着粮车走进战区，故意站到军官的枪口前。",
      "reading_units": 20,
      "start_frame": 932,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 1012
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "shot": "07-checkpoint",
      "text": "结果枪先散了架。我没碰他，整条运粮通道就让开了。",
      "reading_units": 21,
      "start_frame": 1012,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 1096
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "shot": "08-welcome",
      "text": "回国那天，朵朵把白兔塞给我，说它能保平安。",
      "reading_units": 18,
      "start_frame": 1096,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 1168
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "shot": "08-welcome",
      "text": "我妈拎着保温桶来接我。我还惦记着，回家喝她炖的汤。",
      "reading_units": 22,
      "start_frame": 1168,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 1256
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "shot": "09-attack",
      "text": "可下一秒，一个灰衣男人拿着刀，突然冲向了我。",
      "reading_units": 19,
      "start_frame": 1256,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 1332
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "shot": "09-attack",
      "text": "我还以为，这次也只是把刀拆掉，跟以前一样。",
      "reading_units": 18,
      "start_frame": 1332,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 1404
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "shot": "10-removal",
      "text": "刀确实碎了。可那个人，也跟着不见了。",
      "reading_units": 15,
      "start_frame": 1404,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 1464
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "shot": "10-removal",
      "text": "我盯着地上的空衣服，才听明白，他已经死了。",
      "reading_units": 18,
      "start_frame": 1464,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 1536
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "shot": "11-cost",
      "text": "我追问原因。保险给我的解释，是反复处理他不划算。",
      "reading_units": 21,
      "start_frame": 1557,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 1641
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "shot": "11-cost",
      "text": "我这才发现，它已经把救命，升级成了提前清除风险。",
      "reading_units": 21,
      "start_frame": 1641,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 1725
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "shot": "12-no-food",
      "text": "我不敢再出门。我拿自己威胁它，只要再有人消失，我就不吃饭。",
      "reading_units": 25,
      "start_frame": 1725,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 1825
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "shot": "12-no-food",
      "text": "第三天，我却连饿都感觉不到了。它直接取消了我的进食需求。",
      "reading_units": 25,
      "start_frame": 1825,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 1925
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "shot": "13-live",
      "text": "我只能开直播，求所有人帮我解除这份合同。",
      "reading_units": 18,
      "start_frame": 1940,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 2012
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "shot": "13-live",
      "text": "看到各地有人回应，我刚有一点希望，它就把这些帮助算成了风险。",
      "reading_units": 27,
      "start_frame": 2012,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 2120
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "shot": "14-hug",
      "text": "我赶紧关掉直播，冲进厨房，把我妈紧紧抱住。",
      "reading_units": 18,
      "start_frame": 2132,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 2204
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "shot": "14-hug",
      "text": "我想着，只要我不松手，她总该还在我怀里。",
      "reading_units": 17,
      "start_frame": 2204,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 2272
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "shot": "15-mother-gone",
      "text": "可我抱着的，忽然只剩下一条围裙。",
      "reading_units": 14,
      "start_frame": 2296,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 2352
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "shot": "15-mother-gone",
      "text": "汤勺落地。我妈连那半句话，都没来得及说完。",
      "reading_units": 18,
      "start_frame": 2352,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 2424
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "shot": "16-call",
      "text": "我跑出去给朵朵打电话，铃声一直响，却再也没人接。",
      "reading_units": 21,
      "start_frame": 2487,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 2571
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "shot": "16-call",
      "text": "我抱着她送的白兔，第一次觉得，平安这两个字这么冷。",
      "reading_units": 22,
      "start_frame": 2571,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 2659
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "shot": "17-empty-train",
      "text": "我走进地铁，列车照常进站，广播照常响。",
      "reading_units": 16,
      "start_frame": 2659,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 2723
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "shot": "17-empty-train",
      "text": "可站台、车厢，还有我经过的街道，全都只剩下空衣服。",
      "reading_units": 21,
      "start_frame": 2723,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 2807
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "shot": "18-zero",
      "text": "我看见报告上，未承保自然人的数量，已经变成了零。",
      "reading_units": 21,
      "start_frame": 2822,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 2906
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "shot": "18-zero",
      "text": "我连孩子都替他们问过。它连孩子长大后的风险，也算进去了。",
      "reading_units": 25,
      "start_frame": 2906,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 3006
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "shot": "19-empty-chair",
      "text": "我回到家，把第二只碗放到对面的空椅子前。",
      "reading_units": 18,
      "start_frame": 3024,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 3096
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "shot": "19-empty-chair",
      "text": "我不再求它拯救世界。我只想让它，把我妈还给我。",
      "reading_units": 20,
      "start_frame": 3096,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 3176
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
      "shot": "20-safe",
      "text": "可我的请求，依旧不符合它的安全标准。",
      "reading_units": 16,
      "start_frame": 3194,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 3258
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "shot": "20-safe",
      "text": "我终于安全了。只是这个世界，再也没有别人。",
      "reading_units": 18,
      "start_frame": 3258,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 3330
    }
  ],
  "aspect_ratio": "16:9"
}
